{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1215279-voice-acting-request-changeling-the-lost-british-english","id":1215279,"title":"Voice acting request (Changeling the Lost) [British English]","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2018-05-04T17:28:35-07:00","id":1215279,"title":"Voice acting request (Changeling the Lost) [British English]","content":"<span style=\"color:#222222\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\">I'm starting a noir-themed </span></span><i>Changeling the Lost</i><span style=\"color:#222222\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\"> campaign and the first session involves players becoming the Freehold's sheriff. Their first case investigating the death of the previous sheriff (a mentor and hero figure). Naturally, as it's noir-theme, this investigation will change the way this hero is seen and the murderer, when caught, will be able to play back the murder using a Contract and a reflective surface.</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#222222\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\">I've used audio logs and even videos in games before but most of my usual stable of acting friends are in this game (and the few that remain aren't right for the parts). </span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#222222\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\">Here's the script...</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#222222\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\"><div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">JOHN: Quill. Nice to see you. So what was so important you had to meet in secret? I\u2019d written Dunbar off as a suicide. You got something to show me?</div></div> </div> </div></span></span><div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><br /> <span style=\"color:#222222\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\">QUILL: I suppose I have, actually. Mostly, though, I\u2019ve got something to tell you. </span></span><i>I know</i><span style=\"color:#222222\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\">.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#222222\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\">JOHN: Huh. Nice piece. Know what?</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#222222\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\">QUILL: About Claire Grey. About my sister, John. About what you did with her.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#222222\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\">JOHN: Fuck.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#222222\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\">QUILL: Stay where you are, John. Claws where I can see them. I have to know, John. How long have you been working for </span></span><i>them? </i><span style=\"color:#222222\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\">Were you always a loyalist?</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#222222\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\">JOHN: OK\u2026 Listen carefully. I respect that you want the truth, that you didn\u2019t just come in shooting. For all you knew, you could have killed an innocent man.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#222222\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\">Well\u2026 I ain\u2019t an innocent man, Quill. I did it. But there\u2019s more you\u2019ve gotta know. I ain\u2019t asking you for forgiveness. I ain\u2019t gonna try and justify what I did. I also ain\u2019t gonna beg for mercy. But you want the truth and I think you deserve that much. I\u2019ll tell you the truth and then I\u2019ll leave justice in your hands. That seems fair to me.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#222222\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\">QUILL: OK. Talk.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#222222\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\">JOHN: Mind if I smoke? It\u2019s kinda traditional. Yeah, I made a deal with the devil. Three devils, specifically. One a year, to each of them, to their\u2026 specifications. A tithe to hell to keep them from coming here, from taking </span></span><i>more</i><span style=\"color:#222222\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\">.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#222222\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\">These three... They\u2019re not like the rest of Gentry, happy to sit and play king in their little fucked up kingdoms, kidnapping a new plaything from time to time. They\u2019re much more interested in other things. The Dollmaker, he\u2019s the least of them, we\u2019re all fuckin\u2019 toys to him and he lives to make and remake us. The other two, well, one wants to make his little kingdom right here and I ain\u2019t got a clue what the last one wants but even by the standards of the Others it\u2019s fucked up.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#222222\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\">QUILL: How long has this been going on?</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#222222\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\">JOHN: Years. Ever since I took apart that Privateer ring.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#222222\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\">QUILL: That was nearly fifteen years ago. That\u2019s\u2026 forty-five people you\u2019ve sold to them.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#222222\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\">JOHN: Thirty-nine. I remember all their names and faces. I owe them that much. I know it ain\u2019t worth shit, but I\u2019m sorry about your sister, I really am.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#222222\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\">They sent their Huntsmen for me after I cut off their supply. I killed them all, killed several of them over the next two years before their bosses decided to talk instead. I knew I couldn\u2019t fight three Others, not all at once, but I played hardball. Those thirty-nine\u2026 That\u2019s nothing compared to what those privateer fucks did, and if I didn\u2019t the bloody triad would have come for the Freehold. And you saw what happened with the Prince. We can\u2019t fight one of them, let alone three.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#222222\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\">It was a terrible thing I did. I don\u2019t know if it was the wrong thing, though, even though it was undeniably </span></span><i>a</i><span style=\"color:#222222\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\"> wrong thing. Sometimes you find yourself facing a question where all the answers are wrong.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#222222\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\">QUILL: For what it\u2019s worth, and I know it isn\u2019t worth shit, I\u2019m sorry too.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#222222\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\">JOHN: You\u2019re going to kill me, huh? Don\u2019t worry, I\u2019m\u2026</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#222222\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\">[Gunshot]</span></span><br /> </div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#222222\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\">Quill, who has fewer lines, is female (probably RP/Southern sounding but I'm open to other accents) and probably vibrating with righteous anger and fear (she's not the naturally violent type). I've played around with various regional accents for John (who I want to have much more working class sound) - London, Northern, Irish, Scottish - but sadly I don't have a grizzled enough voicebox or a good enough accent to pull it off. </span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#222222\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\">Anyone willing to lend me their vocal talents?</span></span>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>Onyx Path Freelancer: Demon Storyteller's Guide, Dark Eras, Night Horrors: Enemy Action</i><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/825063-storyteller-s-guide-extra-material\" target=\"_blank\">Storyteller's Guide Extra Material</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/899423-after-the-fall-bonus-material\" target=\"_blank\">After the Fall: Bonus Material</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/452-eremite","name":"Eremite","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar452_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"355"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-04T18:41:35-07:00","id":1215306,"title":"","content":"While I've been told I can do a decent enough Northshire accent, I definitely don't do grizzled without three glasses of whiskey, and I don't reckon you want drunkard British.<br /> <br /> EDIT: Also, I just looked up Northshire, and I am pretty sure that's actually a WoW thing now.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":99,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","user":"ArcaneArts","date":". 05-04-2018, 09:46 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-04T21:10:54-07:00","id":1215337,"title":"","content":"*eyes microphone*<br /> <br /> ...sure. Gimme a bit.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}